@startuml
autonumber
actor "Operator\n(Consola)" as User
participant "Business Service" as BS
participant "MQTT Broker" as Broker
participant "Device Simulator\n(device-1)" as Dev1

== Flux 1: Declanșare și Propagare Alarmă ==
Dev1 -> Dev1: Masurare periodica: T = 28.42 > 28.00\n(Verificare MIN_INTERARRIVAL_MS)
Dev1 -> Broker: PUBLISH ssatr/.../devices/device-1/alarm\n{"temp": 28.42, "threshold": 28.00}
Broker -> BS: ARRIVE ssatr/.../devices/device-1/alarm
BS -> BS: Actualizare stare memorie (alarms_count++)
BS -> BS: Append record in data/alarm.csv
BS -> User: [ALARMA] device-1: temperatura 28.42 depaseste pragul 28.00

== Flux 2: Comandă Asincronă SET_INTERVAL 1000 ==
User -> BS: Tastare: device-1 SET_INTERVAL 1000
BS -> Broker: PUBLISH ssatr/.../devices/device-1/command\n"SET_INTERVAL 1000"
Broker -> Dev1: ARRIVE ssatr/.../devices/device-1/command
Dev1 -> Dev1: Executie aperiodica: actualizare period = 1000 ms
Dev1 -> Broker: PUBLISH ssatr/.../devices/device-1/status\n"OK SET_INTERVAL 1000"
Broker -> BS: ARRIVE ssatr/.../devices/device-1/status
BS -> BS: Append record in data/status.csv
BS -> User: [STATUS] device-1: OK SET_INTERVAL 1000

@enduml
